  "info": {
    "name": "Rate Limiter",
    "description": "Admin requests and POST /v1/check requests. Run top to bottom: the first request saves tenantId and apiKey, the rule requests save ruleId, and each request asserts its status code. The check folders create their own tenant and rule, and need Redis running as well as Postgres.",
